  "description": {
   "en": "Ye Xi is as ordinary as a girl can get. No matter what she tries, she’s never the worst at it—but she’s never the best, either. She’s practically invisible, completely unnoticed… until she meets Li Zhao.\n\nLi Zhao has her own goal: she wants to become a top fashion designer. Since she was little, every step she’s taken has brought her closer to that dream.\n\nThis is the story of a group of girls brought together by fashion, who are all chasing their dreams. Along the way, there are occasional lighthearted, silly everyday moments thrown in!"
  },
